      "mentions": [
        "char_green_ant_ascetic",
        "char_zui_xian_weng",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The method sits inside Wine Fairy true inheritance together with Green Ant Ascetic’s enslavement path line.",
      "chapters": [
        2110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_wine_fairy_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Zui Xian Weng leaves, Heavenly Court traps him; Qin Ding Ling lets him keep the inheritance and asks for a written copy while promising to try providing relevant Immortal Gu. She later tells Gu Yue Fang Zheng that the inheritance’s greatest value is not golden bottle drunken wine but the human path wine drinker Immortal Gu recipe the couple created together.",
      "chapters": [
        2110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-judgment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "gu_wine_drinker_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Zheng notes that even if golden bottle drunken wine is effective and kills Wu Shuai, Wu Shuai is only Fang Yuan’s clone and would not shake Fang Yuan’s foundation, especially with Dragon Palace already destroyed. Qin Ding Ling treats that reading as correct and places priority on human path and bringing Star Constellation Immortal Venerable back instead.",
      "chapters": [
